      "side": 1,
      "message": "What is our motivation to remove \u0027board\u0027 from the paths? I\u0027m not saying one is right vs wrong, but this requires a code change so want to make sure there\u0027s a benefit.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 523,
        "startChar": 39,
