      "writtenOn": "2026-10-27T05:55:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This design proposal adds D-Bus object for every entity(if suitable PDI exists), and most of them are not boards (Cpu, Fan, PowerSupply, ...). \n\nKeeping them under `board/` might confuses human inspector that \"they are boards\", so I moved the created terminus and entity object go directly under `/xyz/openbmc_project/inventory/system/` to improve the readability.\n\nAs of my opinion, this will have no impact on how they work(as consumers such as `bmcweb` searches these objects by interface and association).",
      "parentUuid": "de37385f_fae48cc7",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 523,
        "startChar": 39,
        "endLine": 523,
        "endChar": 44
      },
